# Deploy only the web app (index.html, main.mjs, styles/, vendor/, vercel.json and,
# later, api/, lib/, levels/ ...). Tests, tooling and docs stay out of the deployment.
# tools/serve.mjs reads this file and 404s the same paths locally; it supports only
# `dir/`, `name` and `*.ext` (any depth) and `/dir/`, `/name`, `a/b` (anchored to the
# root). Top-level tooling dirs are anchored so a future lib/test/ or api/tools/ deploys.
/.claude/
/.github/
/docs/
/test/
/tools/
CLAUDE.md
README.md
.nvmrc
.gitignore
.vercelignore
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules/
vendor/README.md
vendor/SHA256SUMS
.env
.env.*
.vercel
*.log
